# Minimal defer/feed pipeline (isolated from generators).
#
# A `defer()` channel fed from TWO sites — a scalar seed and a per-iteration
# `<<` inside a `for` loop — then collapsed with `max`. The two feed sites
# fan in to one channel during channelization; that channel union is the
# synthesized structure to look at in the inspector.
readings = [1, 2, 3, 4]
totals = defer()
totals << sum(readings)
for x in readings:
    totals << x
max(totals)
